OL,3,ABids encouraged to keep famed artwork
OL,4,Ain the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA painting by one of Britain's leading
OL,7,F20th Century artists must stay in the
OL,8,Fcountry in the hope that one of its
OL,9,Fgalleries or institutions will buy it,
OL,10,Fthe government said.
OL,12,FSir Stanley Spencer, who was born and
OL,13,Fspent most of his life in Cookham,
OL,14,FBerkshire, is probably best known for
OL,15,Fthe series of artworks he created on
OL,16,Fthe theme of resurrection.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
